# Fresh process, reusing only the first process's isolated ordinary profile.
settle 40
key escape
assert physics paused
act Fit to view
settle 5
record-graph-folds 08_reopened 2
capture 08_reopened
act Expand fold
settle 5
record-graph-folds 09_expanded 1
capture 09_expanded
act Undo fold
settle 5
record-graph-folds 10_reopen_undo 2
act Redo fold
settle 5
record-graph-folds 11_reopen_redo 1
act Expand all folds
settle 5
record-graph-folds 12_all_expanded 0
capture 12_all_expanded
log Reopened folds expanded and persisted without changing source members
